WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.467
-A federal judge said today

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.801
that Donald Trump's attempted
coup is likely a crime

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.734
as bombshell
new reporting revealed

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:08.601
that both
Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:11.067
and the wife of Supreme
Court Justice Clarence Thomas

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:12.400
were closely involved

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.200
in Trump's attempt
to overturn the election.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.567
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:20.834
♪♪

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:23.000
Look, let's just get this
out of the way.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.734
Obviously, what everyone

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.300
would rather be talking
about right now

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.467
instead of politics is the big
moment from last night's Oscars.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.834
You all know
what I'm talking about.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:34.601
Of course, that instantly
iconic and unforgettable moment

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:38.000
when the Flash entered
the Speed Force.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.834
We all saw Oscar's history
unfold

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:41.767
live before our eyes
when that famous scene

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:43.334
finally got the recognition
it deserved.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.200
And clearly, that's what
everyone is talking about today.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.200
Did you see
Nicole Kidman's reaction?

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.367
That was either her face
finding out

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:51.934
the Flash
had entered the Speed Force

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.434
or when she discovered
her mysterious British husband

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:55.667
was indeed the murderer.

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:57.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:59.133
Anyway, unfortunately
this is a segment

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.000
that's kind of supposed
to be about politics,

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.200
and that's what we have
to talk about,

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.767
which means it's time
for a classic

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.067
"Late Night" smooth segue.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.567
[ Smooth jazz playing ]

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.834
Here we go. Ready?

00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:13.567
And now
the "Closer Look" begins.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:17.534
[ Clears throat ]

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:20.033
Donald Trump's personal sway
over the Republican Party

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.400
seems as strong as ever,

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.267
even if at times the candidates
he backs fall flat.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.367
In some places,
Trump-endorsed candidates

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.834
are struggling in GOP primaries

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.200
and having a hard time
raising money.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.067
But in other places like Texas,

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:33.234
his endorsement
was still very powerful.

00:01:33.234 --> 00:01:36.234
And it's shocking to me
how popular he remains in Texas,

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:38.200
given how stupid he looks
in a cowboy hat.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:41.367
He looks like an undercover cop

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.734
trying to bust up
a cattle rustling operation.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:44.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.334
On top of that,
Trump keeps strongly hinting

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:48.734
that he's going
to run in 2024,

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:51.234
but his crowds aren't
exactly getting bigger.

00:01:51.234 --> 00:01:52.701
A reporter at Trump's
rally in Georgia

00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:53.934
over the weekend tweeted...

00:02:01.834 --> 00:02:04.133
The reporter also posted
a photo from the event

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.467
that showed plenty
of empty seats.

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:07.868
Normally, you only see
that many empty seats

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:10.133
at a community theatre
production of "Hamilton"

00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:13.567
where they couldn't get
the rights to any of the songs.

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:15.767
♪ My name is Alex
and I'm here to say ♪

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:19.367
♪ "Let's tell the British
to go away" ♪

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:21.200
There's even video of people
in the crowd

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.400
filing out early as Trump
was still speaking.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.734
-The leaders who are
going to save your state

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:29.868
from this anarchy and betrayal,
your state...

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:31.767
-They're like Mets fans
heading to the subway

00:02:31.767 --> 00:02:33.968
in the seventh inning
of a 10-run blowout.

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:35.868
Only a few more weeks until

00:02:35.868 --> 00:02:37.934
that starts happening again,
the crew.

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:41.167
Also, I love that
in that snippet you can hear

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.934
Trump yelling something
about anarchy and betrayal.

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:46.167
He sounds like he's reviewing
last night's Oscars.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:48.267
[ Imitating Trump ] "There
was anarchy, betrayal, chaos,

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.300
and for some reason --
some reason,

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.000
a tribute to 'Pulp Fiction.'

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.100
And yet all these years later,

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.334
we still don't know
what was in the briefcase.

00:02:57.334 --> 00:03:01.701
Why won't they tell us
what was in the briefcase?

00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:03.400
Probably votes for Biden."

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.601 --> 00:03:06.667
[ Normal voice ]
Trump's crowd was still

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:07.968
bored out of their minds,

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:10.267
even though he was busting
out his greatest hits.

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:12.634
They watch his rallies
the way I watch "Shawshank"

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:13.601
on a Sunday afternoon.

00:03:13.601 --> 00:03:15.501
It's comforting, it's familiar,

00:03:15.501 --> 00:03:17.267
and I definitely don't
make it to the end.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:18.834
So in many ways,

00:03:18.834 --> 00:03:21.334
Trump remains the most powerful
presence in the GOP.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:24.033
But there are some early signs
that his personal grip

00:03:24.033 --> 00:03:25.400
over the party
could be slipping.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.801
And I certainly
don't want to jinx it,

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:30.667
given that I've written him off
before and been very wrong.

00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:32.868
In fact, at this point,
I just have to assume

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:35.200
that everything I predict
about Trump is 100% wrong,

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.000
which is why today
I called my bookie

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.434
and I put a million bucks
on him to win in 2024,

00:03:39.434 --> 00:03:41.100
hoping that means he'll lose.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.267
Only problem is, I didn't have
a million bucks on me,

00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:45.567
so I had to borrow it
from our cue card guy, Wally,

00:03:45.567 --> 00:03:47.968
who has been cashing in
on his fame from this show.

00:03:47.968 --> 00:03:50.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:55.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
Sorry, what?

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:56.934
What is Wallycoin?

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:58.334
-Seth, that's
my new cryptocurrency.

00:03:58.334 --> 00:04:00.400
-Why do you have
a cryptocurrency?

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.200
-So I can buy NFCs.
-You mean NFTs.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.467
-No, no, no. NFCs --
nonfungible cue cards.

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.934
Seth, it's a picture of an ape
holding a cue card,

00:04:08.934 --> 00:04:10.400
and you get to own
a picture of it

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.200
for as little as five grand.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:16.200
-Wally!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:18.667
Anyway, the point is
Trump's personal sway

00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:21.100
over the GOP
may or may not be waning.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.167
Only time will tell.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:23.634
But even if Trump himself
fades away,

00:04:23.634 --> 00:04:25.734
Trumpism and
the Republican Party he molded

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:27.067
will very much remain.

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:29.434
Aspiring Republicans
are all desperate to mimic him,

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:32.534
and the central animating force
of Republican politics today

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:33.934
is still the rejection
of democracy.

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:36.234
Just look at Georgia
gubernatorial candidate

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:37.901
David Perdue, an ex-senator

00:04:37.901 --> 00:04:39.601
who's trying
to court Trump's base

00:04:39.601 --> 00:04:42.067
by repeating his lies
about the 2020 election

00:04:42.067 --> 00:04:44.834
and blaming the current
Republican governor,

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.033
Brian Kemp,

00:04:46.033 --> 00:04:47.901
for allowing Democrats
to steal the election.

00:04:47.901 --> 00:04:50.667
-Let me be very clear --
very clear.

00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:53.400
In the state of Georgia,

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.601
thanks to Brian Kemp,

00:04:55.601 --> 00:04:59.367
our elections in 2020
were absolutely stolen.

00:04:59.367 --> 00:05:02.667
And I'm fighting right now to
find out what happened in 2020

00:05:02.667 --> 00:05:05.601
and make sure that
those people responsible

00:05:05.601 --> 00:05:07.400
for that fraud in 2020

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.367
go to jail!

00:05:08.367 --> 00:05:10.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:10.133 --> 00:05:14.334
[ Crowd chanting
"Lock them up" ]

00:05:14.334 --> 00:05:17.701
-Trump's crowds will chant
"lock them up" about anyone now.

00:05:17.701 --> 00:05:20.968
You can be Hillary Clinton
or the ultra-conservative

00:05:20.968 --> 00:05:22.367
governor of Georgia,
it doesn't matter.

00:05:22.367 --> 00:05:24.767
If you cross Trump,
they want you in jail.

00:05:24.767 --> 00:05:27.567
Next, they're going to turn
their ire on wind and umbrellas

00:05:27.567 --> 00:05:29.400
and the sun.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.801
And there are times
when I have to say even Trump

00:05:31.801 --> 00:05:33.434
doesn't seem
to have his heart in it.

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:34.767
Trump's whole bit is trolling.

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.133
He trolls the media
and liberals,

00:05:36.133 --> 00:05:38.067
and his disciples
have picked up the mantle

00:05:38.067 --> 00:05:39.834
like Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz,

00:05:39.834 --> 00:05:41.767
the only person on Earth --
this is interesting --

00:05:41.767 --> 00:05:44.968
who's Funko Pop
would have a smaller head.

00:05:44.968 --> 00:05:46.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.734 --> 00:05:48.934
Gaetz appeared at the rally
and once again

00:05:48.934 --> 00:05:50.767
floated an idea
he's pitched before --

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:52.267
to make Trump
Speaker of the House

00:05:52.267 --> 00:05:54.133
if Republicans win
the midterms in November.

00:05:54.133 --> 00:05:56.601
But Trump did not have
much of a reaction.

00:05:56.601 --> 00:05:58.167
-Give us the ability

00:05:58.167 --> 00:06:00.267
to fire Nancy Pelosi,

00:06:00.267 --> 00:06:02.400
take back the majority,

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.534
impeach Joe Biden,

00:06:04.534 --> 00:06:06.934
and I'm gonna nominate
Donald Trump

00:06:06.934 --> 00:06:11.000
for Speaker of the United States
House of Representatives!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:17.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:19.400
-Thank you very much.
Thank you, everybody.

00:06:22.334 --> 00:06:23.901
Well, that was interesting.

00:06:23.901 --> 00:06:27.400
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.968
-He sounds like a dad

00:06:28.968 --> 00:06:31.634
whose teenager
just made him watch "Euphoria"

00:06:31.634 --> 00:06:33.100
for the first time.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:37.000
"Well, that was...
very interesting.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.701
Hey, I'm gonna come to school
with you tomorrow.

00:06:38.701 --> 00:06:39.801
No.

00:06:39.801 --> 00:06:41.901
For the whole day."
[ Laughter ]

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:44.067
So, regardless of what happens
with Trump himself,

00:06:44.067 --> 00:06:46.567
Trumpism is very much the heart
of the GOP and here to stay.

00:06:46.567 --> 00:06:48.534
And it's not just
the Matt Gaetzes

00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:49.667
and David Perdues of the world.

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:51.567
Republicans at the highest
echelons of power

00:06:51.567 --> 00:06:53.667
have fully embraced
the conspiracy theories

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:55.868
and authoritarian impulses
that defined Trumpism.

00:06:55.868 --> 00:06:58.234
Last week, for example,
we learned about bombshell

00:06:58.234 --> 00:07:00.167
text messages
from Ginni Thomas,

00:07:00.167 --> 00:07:02.801
the wife of Supreme Court
Justice Clarence Thomas,

00:07:02.801 --> 00:07:04.534
to Trump's Chief of Staff,
Mark Meadows,

00:07:04.534 --> 00:07:06.968
pushing the Trump administration
to overturn the election.

00:07:06.968 --> 00:07:09.167
-Tonight, our chief election
and campaign correspondent

00:07:09.167 --> 00:07:12.901
Robert Costa and Bob Woodward
have uncovered text messages

00:07:12.901 --> 00:07:16.434
between the wife of Supreme
Court Justice Clarence Thomas

00:07:16.434 --> 00:07:19.567
and President Trump's top aide,
in which she repeatedly

00:07:19.567 --> 00:07:22.901
pushed to overturn
the 2020 presidential election.

00:07:22.901 --> 00:07:26.100
-The first message from Thomas
came the day before Joe Biden

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:29.834
was declared the winner of
the 2020 presidential election.

00:07:29.834 --> 00:07:31.834
"Do not concede," she wrote.

00:07:31.834 --> 00:07:35.667
"It takes time for the army
who is gathering for his back."

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:38.100
-Holy [bleep], that sounds like
something Saruman would say

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.767
in "Lord of the Rings."
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.767 --> 00:07:44.634
"It takes time for the army,
who is gathering for his back."

00:07:44.634 --> 00:07:47.067
That is very Shakespearean
for someone named Ginni.

00:07:47.067 --> 00:07:50.033
There's not a lot of Ginnis
in Shakespeare.

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:51.367
Just not a Shakespearean name.

00:07:51.367 --> 00:07:54.901
No one's buying tickets
to see "Romeo and Ginni."

00:07:54.901 --> 00:07:58.234
"I liked Romeo, but the
Ginni character was a lot."

00:07:58.234 --> 00:08:00.534
And let's not forget
the reason this is so shocking

00:08:00.534 --> 00:08:02.968
is Trump was open
about his desire

00:08:02.968 --> 00:08:04.834
to have the Supreme Court
help him stay in power.

00:08:04.834 --> 00:08:07.667
He said it repeatedly and took
his case to the Supreme Court.

00:08:07.667 --> 00:08:09.801
There was even a case
where Trump sued

00:08:09.801 --> 00:08:11.234
to block the National Archives

00:08:11.234 --> 00:08:13.701
from releasing any records
related to January 6th.

00:08:13.701 --> 00:08:16.534
And the only justice
to side with Trump

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:19.367
in that eight-to-one
ruling was Clarence Thomas.

00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:21.901
He sided with Trump in the case
to block the release of records

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.868
that could have potentially
implicated his own wife.

00:08:23.868 --> 00:08:26.567
That is a slap in the face
to the Constitution.

00:08:26.567 --> 00:08:28.367
And even if it was
to protect your wife,

00:08:28.367 --> 00:08:30.634
slapping is never okay!

00:08:30.634 --> 00:08:32.400
[ Laughter, cheering ]

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.000
No slapping!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.901
So it's a massive scandal.
Although, I get it.

00:08:39.901 --> 00:08:41.534
If I were sending
crazy [bleep] like that,

00:08:41.534 --> 00:08:43.300
my wife would want
those texts blocked too.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.734
In fact, I'm pretty sure she
already has my number blocked

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:47.133
because I keep texting her

00:08:47.133 --> 00:08:48.834
"Do you like my Pacino
impression?"

00:08:48.834 --> 00:08:51.534
and I get no response.

00:08:51.534 --> 00:08:54.734
[ Imitating Pacino ]
I can't believe my own wife...

00:08:54.734 --> 00:08:56.534
left me on read!

00:08:56.534 --> 00:08:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.901
[ Applause ]

00:09:02.901 --> 00:09:05.133
[ Normal voice ] And it wasn't
just -- Don't you dare.

00:09:05.133 --> 00:09:08.167
Don't you dare ruin
what clapping means forever.

00:09:08.167 --> 00:09:09.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.934
And it wasn't just Ginni Thomas.

00:09:10.934 --> 00:09:12.100
This morning,
"The Washington Post"

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.367
also reported on Ted Cruz's
last-ditch battle

00:09:14.367 --> 00:09:15.968
to keep Trump in power,
including

00:09:15.968 --> 00:09:17.167
working directly with Trump

00:09:17.167 --> 00:09:18.667
to concoct a plan
that came closer

00:09:18.667 --> 00:09:20.734
than wildly realized
keeping him in power.

00:09:20.734 --> 00:09:22.367
Of course Ted Cruz was involved.

00:09:22.367 --> 00:09:25.400
If there's a rotting, insidious
idea somewhere, anywhere,

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:28.367
it's more likely than not
that Ted Cruz had a role in it.

00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:30.033
He was probably the one
who told Trump,

00:09:30.033 --> 00:09:33.601
"That had looks great on you,
sir."

00:09:33.601 --> 00:09:36.300
And these two were apparently
in constant communication

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.734
throughout the months-long
coup attempt

00:09:37.734 --> 00:09:39.267
that culminated
in the January 6th riot.

00:09:39.267 --> 00:09:40.300
According to "The Post"...

00:10:04.868 --> 00:10:06.400
First of all, I have
a hard time believing

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.567
their phone conversations
were that brief.

00:10:08.567 --> 00:10:10.868
I don't think Trump has ever
made a short phone call

00:10:10.868 --> 00:10:12.267
in his entire life.

00:10:12.267 --> 00:10:14.567
Remember when he used to call
in to the "Fox &amp; Friends"

00:10:14.567 --> 00:10:18.868
while they just sat there
without blinking for an hour,

00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:21.701
just staring into the void,
wondering, "Am I dead,

00:10:21.701 --> 00:10:25.400
and is this my punishment?"
[ Laughter ]

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.400
So Cruz was deeply involved
in Trump's effort

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.534
to overthrow the election.

00:10:28.534 --> 00:10:30.934
Fortunately for us,
Cruz's last-ditch effort

00:10:30.934 --> 00:10:32.234
to overturn the election

00:10:32.234 --> 00:10:34.434
went about as well
as his last-ditch effort

00:10:34.434 --> 00:10:36.100
to get on a plane in Montana.

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.100
-New video this morning
showing the moments before

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:41.601
airport security was called
on Texas Senator Ted Cruz.

00:10:41.601 --> 00:10:44.334
He missed his flight check
on Sunday in Bozeman, Montana,

00:10:44.334 --> 00:10:47.334
and options to reschedule were
limited because of spring break.

00:10:47.334 --> 00:10:49.334
So the senator got in
a heated conversation

00:10:49.334 --> 00:10:51.067
with airport employees
over the issue.

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:54.667
-Cops were even called to calm
down the Texas Republican.

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:56.434
It happened at
Bozeman Yellowstone

00:10:56.434 --> 00:10:59.167
International Airport
in Montana.

00:10:59.167 --> 00:11:03.367
A social media posting claimed
that Cruz wouldn't calm down

00:11:03.367 --> 00:11:04.901
and was heard asking...

00:11:06.701 --> 00:11:09.167
-Ted Cruz strikes me
as one of those people

00:11:09.167 --> 00:11:14.033
who hopes the answer to
"Do you know who I am?" is no.

00:11:14.033 --> 00:11:15.734
"Do you know who I am?"
"I don't."

00:11:15.734 --> 00:11:19.100
"Thank God.
I am but a weary traveler...

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.167
who seeks passage home
to my loved ones

00:11:21.167 --> 00:11:23.567
and not, I assure you,
a noxious toady hell-bent

00:11:23.567 --> 00:11:24.801
on destroying
American democracy.

00:11:24.801 --> 00:11:26.400
I've never even been to Cancún."

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:30.400
And then today, after
all those major bombshells,

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.200
a federal judge wrote
in a new court

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.801
filing that
Trump's attempted coup

00:11:33.801 --> 00:11:36.100
was more likely than not
a crime,

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.534
adding that the illegality
of the plan was obvious.

00:11:38.534 --> 00:11:39.534
Yeah, man, no [bleep].

00:11:39.534 --> 00:11:41.100
I'm tired of waiting for judges

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.801
and DAs and special committees
to tell us what we all saw

00:11:43.801 --> 00:11:46.033
with our own eyes
was probably not legal.

00:11:46.033 --> 00:11:47.400
Why is this taking so long?

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.067
This is like if a character
in season eight

00:11:49.067 --> 00:11:50.601
of "Game of Thrones" said,
"Hey, any word

00:11:50.601 --> 00:11:52.234
on whether or not
winter is coming?"

00:11:52.234 --> 00:11:53.834
It's like,
"Where have you been?"

00:11:53.834 --> 00:11:56.467
[ Laughter ]

00:11:56.467 --> 00:12:00.133
"You literally have heard
no update on that?"

00:12:00.133 --> 00:12:01.534
The evidence of
a criminal attempt

00:12:01.534 --> 00:12:03.834
to overthrow American democracy
is so overwhelming

00:12:03.834 --> 00:12:05.133
and involves so many figures

00:12:05.133 --> 00:12:06.667
at the highest levels
of the Republican Party,

00:12:06.667 --> 00:12:07.634
it's hard to fathom.

00:12:07.634 --> 00:12:09.167
And yet still so many

00:12:09.167 --> 00:12:11.501
of our judges and prosecutors
and elected officials

00:12:11.501 --> 00:12:14.801
saw what happened on January
6th, shrugged and said...

00:12:14.801 --> 00:12:16.567
-Well, that was interesting.

00:12:16.567 --> 00:12:17.968
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:17.968 --> 00:12:22.067
♪♪

00:12:22.067 --> 00:12:24.634
God's Love We Deliver cooks
and brings over 2 million meals

00:12:24.634 --> 00:12:26.067
a year to men, women,
and children

00:12:26.067 --> 00:12:29.200
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses,

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.701
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:12:30.701 --> 00:12:33.400
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:36.133
Stay safe, get vaccinated.
We love you.

